{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:32863e2d92caa3f545f74a0d5c347b9743abf54a4d79979bff68748da1a10c0d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af33ea9f4728c5560828c454b1b85d6c38a1dc42f974b5fba2c30d5933f3f8ff",
      "text": "……喂喂？辛苦了，是我。\n现在能稍微借用你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a220a8ae117b770c6026880ef4dc413743279f39581a37be147468d212d603e6",
      "text": "舞台剧的余韵还没散去。\n想着要是能和阁下聊聊就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a176d423f309c4eaf20e4bef16e6e936d075c5d57b6771ce24249fa86e457716",
      "text": "还记得吗？录完音乐节目后，\n我对阁下说的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d306a8167bfd2268f549ce04bb67f2aa80b4d559d04259c0c8acfbbd9b7d1cee",
      "text": "是说想在各方面努力\n的那件事吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6766f29fce1fb0719745f13fd93b4a4080b547f7e67d7bbf74718d9f2f720109",
      "text": "嗯。最近每次和都筑先生一起完成各种工作时，\n都能感受到成长，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04870fb48997771029416124bc8b1c06044b8fbb7f531f385ae961df81c98d26",
      "text": "而这次的舞台剧，更是体会到了\n前所未有的强烈充实感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:684b2abf0626df92c563c53c2bd691f24067774bc87014cfeecb7fd2080a5a1c",
      "text": "是因为挑战了新事物呢，\n还是因为对舞台上饰演的角色产生了情感共鸣呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67bc96f23ffaaffc2e76b88e6b55f570c245f41f1e58f120117c24628076fc78",
      "text": "我现在的心情非常舒畅。\n已经很久没有过这样的感觉了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f7b9ae5e64e059bacc7111e8cf872b54f53667af053ac22a9b412040c991e9e",
      "text": "那太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c0f45d4f4f9a26da2533eefb384109dd6b483b916fa23187691d9673abb40df",
      "text": "嗯。今后我也想继续度过这样\n充实的每一天。我是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_306_2_3_008_06_09_a:2_3_008_06_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f791172ae9303ed2c61b5c7cb7e112d57b0843e83058aaf36f39ebb10672ebf",
      "text": "所以，阁下。虽然有时可能会给你添麻烦，\n但今后也请继续多多支持我。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
